; the bound symbol is a strict PREFIX-length mismatch: pattern needs 3 bytes at arg 2
; but only 2-byte and 4-byte siblings are stored -> descend_to_existing_byte on the
; size byte FAILS (not the check). The `if` must fall through without ascending.
(d abc ab)
(d abc abcd)
(d xyz xyz)
(exec 0 (, (d $x $x)) (, (out $x)))
